        q: { ja: "EV（Enterprise Value）/EBITDA（Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation and Amortization）が実務で好まれる理由として適切でないものは。", en: "Which is NOT a reason EV (Enterprise Value)/EBITDA (Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation and Amortization) is popular?" },
