        sol: { ja: "ICR＝営業利益÷支払利息\n＝3,000万÷4,000万\n＝0.75倍\n答え: 0.75倍（1倍未満＝利息を賄えず危険）", en: "ICR = operating profit ÷ interest\n= 30M ÷ 40M\n= 0.75×\nAnswer: 0.75× (below 1× — cannot cover interest)" },
