        sol: { ja: "BEP(前)＝6,000万/0.35≒1億7,143万円\nBEP(後)＝6,000万/0.45≒1億3,333万円\n低下＝約3,810万円\n答え: BEP売上高が約3,810万円低下（約1.71億→約1.33億）", en: "BEP before = 60M/0.35 ≈ ¥171.43M\nBEP after = 60M/0.45 ≈ ¥133.33M\nReduction ≈ ¥38.1M\nAnswer: BEP falls ~¥38.1M (~¥171M→~¥133M)" },
