      q: { ja: "買収EV（Enterprise Value） 500、負債400・エクイティ100で取得。5年後にEBITDA（Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation and Amortization）は横ばい・EV倍率も横ばいでEVは500のまま。純負債を150まで返済した。エクイティ価値は？", en: "Acquired at EV (Enterprise Value) 500 with 400 debt / 100 equity. After 5 years EBITDA (Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation and Amortization) and multiple are flat so EV stays 500. Net debt paid down to 150. Equity value?" },
