      q: { ja: "相対市場シェアを求める。自社シェア20%、最大競合シェア40%。BCG（Boston Consulting Group）上の相対市場シェアは？また象限は（市場成長率が高い前提）？", en: "Compute relative market share. Own share 20%, largest rival 40%. Relative market share and BCG (Boston Consulting Group) quadrant (assume high market growth)?" },
      sol: { ja: "相対シェア=自社/最大競合=20/40=0.5x（<1で劣位）。\\n高成長×低シェア→『問題児(question mark)』。選別投資かハーベストを判断。", en: "Relative share=20/40=0.5x (<1, trailing).\\nHigh growth × low share → 'question mark'. Decide selective investment or harvest." },
