      sol: { ja: "V・R・Iを満たしても O が欠けると、潜在的優位を実現できず『未活用の競争優位』にとどまる。\\n組織（構造・プロセス・報酬）を整えれば持続的競争優位に転換可能。", en: "With V, R, I met but O missing, the potential advantage goes unrealized ('unused competitive advantage').\\nFixing the organization (structure, process, incentives) can convert it into sustained advantage." },
