      sol: { ja: "ROIC差=20%−8%=12%。\\n移動額10×12%=1.2の追加年間リターン。\\n資源の硬直（前年踏襲）を崩し高ROIC事業へ動かすことが価値を生む。", en: "ROIC gap=20%−8%=12%.\\nShifting 10 adds 10×12%=1.2 in annual return.\\nBreaking allocation inertia toward high-ROIC units creates value." },
