    whatEn: "A pioneering finance-specific self-pretrained model. But general frontier models + RAG/tuning soon outperformed it on many tasks, pushing from-scratch pretraining to the last resort.",
    lesson: "カスタマイズには階段がある：プロンプト→RAG→FT/蒸留→（最後に）事前学習。",
